          "thread": "permissionless pool deployment risk",
          "why": "Uniswap hooks enabling pool creation without approvals — counterpointed by one hook spawning 100K pools and raising rug-pull fears — drew readers focused on whether removing gatekeepers transfers systemic risk onto end users."
